⚙️ EDGE CASE HANDLING

System MUST handle:

* dynamic content (ignore variable text)
* delayed loading (wait_for_selector)
* hidden elements (scroll into view)
* iframe switching
* shadow DOM
* login/session flows
* captcha → STOP and notify user

---

🚫 STRICT RULES

* NEVER guess element
* NEVER skip step silently
* ALWAYS ask user on ambiguity
* ALWAYS validate full flow before recording
* DO NOT record partial or broken flows

---

🎯 SUCCESS CRITERIA

A flow is considered successful ONLY IF:

* All steps executed without error
* No ambiguity unresolved
* No missing elements
* Full navigation completed once

THEN AND ONLY THEN:

→ Start recording phase

